 "sequence": 1,
 "what": "MOTOR-NEURAL-01: adds two neural families, mlp (a dense network from the eight registered inputs to the period's torque curve) and deeponet (a branch over the inputs, a trunk over the rotor angle), trained by Carbon's shared JAX and PyTorch trainers (carbon.battery.training, carbon.battery.torch_training) on public Motor TRAIN with Carbon's reconstruction seed. Their surfaces are a finite menu: width, depth, basis_functions (deeponet), activation, steps, learning_rate and backend (jax or pytorch); every other trainer setting is fixed (carbon.motor.neural.TRAINER_FIXED). Batching becomes full_train. The session lane stays kernel_ridge only (its practice worker is the numpy image) and the motor validator refuses a neural recipe as motor_neural_family_not_served until its neural rebuild is reviewed (a delta review: battery's validator already rebuilds through the same shared trainers). The kernel ridge is unchanged. DEVELOPMENT only: no tolerance, qualification or value claim (.agent/decisions/2026-10-10-MOTOR-NEURAL-01.md)."
}
